			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2201688">
									

<p>Written well but ultimately also reminds me of <a href="/scp-1297">SCP-1297</a>, and the concept is played even more straight since the object doing the thing is a mammoth. There's no real cool story or background. You almost come close with the recovery log, specifically this bit:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-2184 was discovered by Agent ████████ in ████ when he conducted a routine investigation to determine whether the mythology of the Siberian ████████-██████ tribe was based on the observation of anomalous objects or phenomena.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>But ultimately, it just falls flat. I wouldn't mind it falling flat if it did it in an interesting way, but when it reminds me of another skip and nothing is really done with it to make it stand out, I can't do anything but downvote.</p>

